  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/vm2XGbH.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/fk8AIEm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"115\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>***&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shetiphiancore\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShetiPhianCore</a> 需要！***</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">將物品儲存於其他維度。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">終界箱</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">所有相同顏色的箱子始終保持連結。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">提供全球、個人與團隊模式。（<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderchests/pages/main\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多詳情</a>）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按住 Shift 並右鍵點擊箱子可更改綁帶顏色。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/756/231/chests-crop.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"459\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">終界包</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">[右鍵] 開啟原版終界箱。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">[左鍵]&nbsp;連結至箱子，方便存取儲存的物品。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按住 Shift 並右鍵點擊箱子即可連結。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/756/236/bag-crop-f.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"473\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">github</a> 上提交本地化檔案。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請勿在留言區回報問題，請使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>。</strong></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
